    "preamble": "S.Kathirvel vs / on 20 December, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.(MD)No.2 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 20.12.2024 Coram: The Honourable Mr.Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.(MD)No.21415 of 2021 and W.M.P.(MD)No.17982 of 2021 S.Kathirvel ... Petit /Vs./ 1. The Food Safety Officer Paanruti Municipality and Block, Cuddalore District. 2. The Adjudicating Authority The District Revenue Officer, Cuddalore District. ... Respo Prayer: Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of Ind issue a Writ of Certiorari, calling for the records relating to the order passed by the second respondent in Case No.16/2020 dated 13.09.2021 and quash the same. For Petitioner : Mr.M.Rajaraman For Respondents : Mr.S.Shanmugavel Additional Government Pleader 1/5 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.( Order S.Kathirvel vs / on 20 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/81386358/ 1",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "4. The learned counsel appearing for the petitioner would submit that it would suffice if the liberty is given to the petitioner file an appeal as against the order passed by the second respondent."
